{"seq":3,"slug":"coupon-lifecycle","title":"券生命周期、核销与退款回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/budget-coupon/coupon-lifecycle","wordCount":1994,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"券生命周期-核销与退款回退\">券生命周期、核销与退款回退</h1><p>券是钱，钱有生命周期。一张券从被领到被用掉或过期，要经过若干状态，每个状态的流转都要么是用户可见的业务动作，要么是时间驱动的后台任务。而其中最考验设计的是<strong>退款</strong>：用户用券买了 300 元的东西，退了其中一件，那张&quot;满 300 减 50&quot;的券该怎么处理？把 50 元按比例退回去，还是退整张券？本篇把这条生命周期与它的边界情况讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>券实例的状态不多，但每条边的语义必须精确：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; UNUSED: 领取成功&#10;  UNUSED --&gt; LOCKED: 下单占用&#10;  LOCKED --&gt; USED: 订单支付成功&#10;  LOCKED --&gt; UNUSED: 订单取消/超时未付&#10;  UNUSED --&gt; EXPIRED: 到期&#10;  LOCKED --&gt; EXPIRED: 到期(锁定中)&#10;  USED --&gt; UNUSED: 整单退款且券未过期&#10;  USED --&gt; EXPIRED: 退款时券已过期&#10;  EXPIRED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; UNUSED: 领取成功\n  UNUSED --&gt; LOCKED: 下单占用\n  LOCKED --&gt; USED: 订单支付成功\n  LOCKED --&gt; UNUSED: 订单取消/超时未付\n  UNUSED --&gt; EXPIRED: 到期\n  LOCKED --&gt; EXPIRED: 到期(锁定中)\n  USED --&gt; UNUSED: 整单退款且券未过期\n  USED --&gt; EXPIRED: 退款时券已过期\n  EXPIRED --&gt; [*]</pre><p>四个状态、七条边，每条边都对应一段代码和一个定时任务。容易出错的地方集中在三处：<code>LOCKED → USED</code> 与 <code>LOCKED → UNUSED</code> 的原子性、过期与核销的竞态、以及退款时&quot;退钱还是退券&quot;的决策。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可执行动作</th>\n<th>计入预算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>UNUSED</code></td>\n<td>已领未用</td>\n<td>下单锁定、过期</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LOCKED</code></td>\n<td>被订单占用</td>\n<td>支付确认、取消释放</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>USED</code></td>\n<td>已核销</td>\n<td>退款回退</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EXPIRED</code></td>\n<td>已过期</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><strong>否</strong>（应从占用中扣除）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得注意：过期券不应再占用预算。若预算计数包含了过期券的面额，运营会看到&quot;预算用尽但没人能用券&quot;的鬼故事。所以过期任务必须同时<strong>扣减预算占用</strong>，这是一条要求两个动作一致的跨界操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态流转的原子性与竞态\">状态流转的原子性与竞态</h2><p><code>LOCKED</code> 状态是必需的，因为下单与支付之间存在时间差。没有它，就会出现&quot;两个订单同时用一张券&quot;——这在<a href=\"../pricing-pipeline/idempotent-pricing\">算价幂等与下单价一致</a>里提到过，这里展开它的实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 下单：占用&#10;UPDATE coupon_instance&#10;   SET status = &#39;LOCKED&#39;, order_id = :oid, locked_at = NOW(3)&#10; WHERE instance_id = :cid AND status = &#39;UNUSED&#39;;&#10;-- 支付成功：核销&#10;UPDATE coupon_instance&#10;   SET status = &#39;USED&#39;, used_at = NOW(3)&#10; WHERE instance_id = :cid AND status = &#39;LOCKED&#39; AND order_id = :oid;&#10;-- 订单取消/超时：释放&#10;UPDATE coupon_instance&#10;   SET status = &#39;UNUSED&#39;, order_id = NULL&#10; WHERE instance_id = :cid AND status = &#39;LOCKED&#39; AND order_id = :oid;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 下单：占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_instance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">oid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, locked_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :cid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UNUSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 支付成功：核销</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_instance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'USED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, used_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :cid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">oid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 订单取消/超时：释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_instance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UNUSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :cid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">oid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条语句都用&quot;状态前置条件&quot;作为 <code>WHERE</code> 的一部分，受影响行数为 0 即表示状态不符（已被别人改过），此时按业务语义处理：占用失败 → 告诉用户券不可用；核销失败 → 说明订单状态异常，走异常流程。这里的可靠性来自 <code>UPDATE</code> 的返回值语义——它返回的是<strong>真正被改动的行数</strong>，<code>WHERE</code> 不匹配时自然为 0（来源：MySQL 8.0 官方手册 UPDATE 语句，<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/update.html\">https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/update.html</a> ）。</p>\n<p><strong>过期与核销的竞态</strong>是最隐蔽的一种。用户在券到期前 1 秒下单，支付发生在到期后 5 分钟——这张券该不该用？两种合理策略，必须显式选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>以下单时刻为准</strong></td>\n<td>券在锁定时有效即可用</td>\n<td>核销不看 <code>endAt</code>，只看 <code>LOCKED</code> 且锁定时刻合法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>以核销时刻为准</strong></td>\n<td>券必须在支付时仍在有效期</td>\n<td>核销额外校验 <code>now &lt;= endAt</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一种对用户更友好，是主流选择。但无论选哪种，<strong>都必须写进配置与文档</strong>，因为它直接决定&quot;到期前抢下最后一单&quot;的用户会不会被拒付。同时过期定时任务必须跳过 <code>LOCKED</code> 状态的券——否则会把一张正在支付的券标记过期，然后核销失败，用户钱付了券没了。这条判定是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE coupon_instance&#10;   SET status = &#39;EXPIRED&#39;&#10; WHERE end_at &lt; NOW(3)&#10;   AND status = &#39;UNUSED&#39;;   -- 关键：不碰 LOCKED\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_instance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EXPIRED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> end_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UNUSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 关键：不碰 LOCKED</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对 <code>LOCKED</code> 且已过期的券，交给&quot;订单超时未支付&quot;这条正常路径去释放，释放后自然进入 <code>EXPIRED</code>。这样两条路径不会互相打脸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核销与业务系统的一致性\">核销与业务系统的一致性</h2><p>券核销必须与订单状态变更在同一个事务里（同库）或通过可靠消息最终一致（跨库）。前者简单，后者要设计补偿：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function onOrderPaid(evt: OrderPaidEvent): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  await tx(async (t) =&gt; {&#10;    const n = await t.coupon.markUsed(evt.couponInstanceId, evt.orderId);&#10;    if (n === 0) {&#10;      // 券状态不是 LOCKED → 数据不一致，记告警并人工介入&#10;      await t.alert.raise(&#39;COUPON_STATE_MISMATCH&#39;, { evt });&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;    await t.ledger.append({&#10;      entryId: `use:${evt.couponInstanceId}`,&#10;      kind: &#39;CONFIRM&#39;,&#10;      amount: evt.deduction,&#10;      ref: evt.orderId,&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onOrderPaid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">evt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderPaidEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.coupon.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">markUsed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(evt.couponInstanceId, evt.orderId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 券状态不是 LOCKED → 数据不一致，记告警并人工介入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.alert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COUPON_STATE_MISMATCH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { evt });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.ledger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      entryId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`use:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">evt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">couponInstanceId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONFIRM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      amount: evt.deduction,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ref: evt.orderId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三点设计意图：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>核销失败不是抛错而是一个告警事件</strong>。订单已经支付了，此时不能让支付回调失败（会导致支付侧重试风暴），正确做法是记录不一致并让对账任务去修。这与&quot;能同步修就同步修、不能就记下来&quot;的取舍有关。</li>\n<li><strong>每张券的变更都追加账本</strong>（<code>entryId</code> 带券 id，天然幂等），使券的生命周期可被完整审计。</li>\n<li><strong>支付回调本身要幂等</strong>：支付渠道会重复回调，<code>markUsed</code> 的状态前置条件天然幂等（第二次 <code>WHERE status=&#39;LOCKED&#39;</code> 不成立），但仍要处理&quot;第二次回调时券已是 USED&quot;的情况——视为成功而非失败。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"退款回退-退钱还是退券\">退款回退：退钱还是退券</h2><p>这是本篇最需要判断力的部分。用户用一张&quot;满 300 减 50&quot;的券购买了 A（200 元）、B（100 元），现在退掉 A，有两种处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>用户得到</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>按比例退钱</strong></td>\n<td>退 A 的实付 = 200 - 50×(200/300) = 166.67</td>\n<td>现金</td>\n<td>部分退款（主流）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>退整张券</strong></td>\n<td>券恢复为 <code>UNUSED</code></td>\n<td>券（若未过期）</td>\n<td>整单退款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>比例退钱的依据是<a href=\"../pricing-pipeline/pricing-stages\">商品价→活动→券→实付的阶段</a>里算出的<strong>行级分摊</strong>——这也是为什么那一步必须从第一版就做。没有分摊，退款时只能猜，猜出来的数必然与用户预期不符。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>退款额</mtext><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>实付</mtext><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>linePayable</mtext><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>salePrice</mtext><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>lineDeductions</mtext><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{退款额}_A = \\text{实付}_A = \\text{linePayable}_A = \\text{salePrice}_A - \\text{lineDeductions}_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退款额</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实付</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">linePayable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">salePrice</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lineDeductions</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键约束是<strong>退款总额不得超过订单实付总额</strong>：逐一退款时，最后一次退款要用&quot;订单实付总额 - 已退总额&quot;而不是再按比例算一次，否则尾差会导致多退。这就是把分摊用整数分（最大余额法消尾差）计算的价值——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>linePayable</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≡</mo><mtext>payable</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{linePayable}_i \\equiv \\text{payable}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">linePayable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payable</span></span></span></span></span></span>，逐行退完刚好等于总额。</p>\n<p>整单退款时，券是否退回取决于三个条件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function onFullRefund(orderId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const c = await coupon.findByOrder(orderId);&#10;  if (!c) return;&#10;  const stillValid = c.endAt &gt; now();&#10;  const policy = c.refundPolicy; // &#39;RETURN&#39; | &#39;CONSUME&#39;&#10;  if (policy === &#39;RETURN&#39; &amp;&amp; stillValid) {&#10;    await coupon.restoreToUnused(c.instanceId); // USED → UNUSED&#10;    await ledger.append({ kind: &#39;REFUND&#39;, entryId: `refund:${c.instanceId}`, ref: orderId });&#10;  } else {&#10;    await coupon.markConsumedByRefund(c.instanceId); // 保持 USED，且不再占用预算&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onFullRefund</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stillValid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.endAt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> policy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.refundPolicy; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 'RETURN' | 'CONSUME'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (policy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RETURN'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stillValid) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">restoreToUnused</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.instanceId); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// USED → UNUSED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ledger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, entryId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`refund:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instanceId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ref: orderId });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">markConsumedByRefund</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.instanceId); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 保持 USED，且不再占用预算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>refundPolicy</code> 必须在<strong>领券时</strong>就确定并告知用户（在券的说明文案里），不能退款时才决定。常见约定是&quot;券随退款退回，但已过期的券不退回&quot;——第一种对用户友好，第二种防止用户在券快过期时刷单。</p>\n<p>一个高频争议点：<strong>部分退款导致订单金额低于券的门槛</strong>。满 300 减 50 的券，退了 A 之后订单只剩 100 元，不足门槛。此时不该追回那 50 元（用户已享受的优惠不追回，这是主流且合法），但也不该再把券退还——券已经&quot;用掉&quot;了。代码上体现为：部分退款不改券状态，只算钱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账-让生命周期可验证\">对账：让生命周期可验证</h2><p>券的生命周期产生了三组应当互相印证的数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>应当满足</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预算占用</td>\n<td><code>promotion_budget.used_amount</code></td>\n<td>= 券实例面额之和（状态 ∈ {UNUSED, LOCKED, USED}）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券状态分布</td>\n<td>券表按状态计数</td>\n<td>每种状态的券数量与状态机流转记录一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账本流水</td>\n<td><code>coupon_ledger</code></td>\n<td>按 <code>promotionId</code> 求和 = 预算占用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三组数的一致性是&quot;没有资损&quot;的证据。定时对账任务应当同时算出三者并输出差异指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT p.promotion_id,&#10;       p.used_amount,&#10;       COALESCE(SUM(c.face_value), 0) AS from_coupons,&#10;       COALESCE((SELECT SUM(amount) FROM coupon_ledger l&#10;                  WHERE l.promotion_id = p.promotion_id), 0) AS from_ledger&#10;  FROM promotion_budget p&#10;  LEFT JOIN coupon_instance c&#10;    ON c.promotion_id = p.promotion_id AND c.status IN (&#39;UNUSED&#39;,&#39;LOCKED&#39;,&#39;USED&#39;)&#10; GROUP BY p.promotion_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promotion_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">used_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">face_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_coupons,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_ledger l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promotion_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promotion_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion_budget p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_instance c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promotion_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promotion_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNUSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promotion_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>差异不为零就是事故信号，且差异的量级直接指向原因（几条券 vs 几万条券）。这套对账与<a href=\"../performance-safety/promotion-observability\">促销效果归因与预算监控</a>共享同一份数据源，区别是这里关注&quot;账对不对&quot;，那里关注&quot;效果好不好&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>券实例有四个状态（<code>UNUSED</code>/<code>LOCKED</code>/<code>USED</code>/<code>EXPIRED</code>）与七条边；<strong><code>LOCKED</code> 是必需的</strong>，它隔开下单与支付之间的时间差，是防&quot;一券两单&quot;的关键。</li>\n<li>所有流转用带<strong>状态前置条件</strong>的原子 <code>UPDATE</code>，受影响行数为 0 即状态不符；失败按业务语义分流，不抛裸错。</li>\n<li>过期任务<strong>必须跳过 <code>LOCKED</code></strong>，否则会把正在支付的券标记过期；<code>LOCKED</code> 的过期券由&quot;订单超时&quot;路径释放。</li>\n<li>券核销要与订单状态同事务或可靠消息一致；核销失败记告警而非阻断支付回调，交给对账修。</li>\n<li>退款回退分两种：<strong>部分退款按行分摊比例退钱</strong>（依赖 <code>linePayable</code>，尾差用最大余额法），<strong>整单退款按 <code>refundPolicy</code> 决定退钱还是退券</strong>，且政策须在领券时告知。</li>\n<li>券的生命周期要能以三组数互相印证（预算占用、状态分布、账本流水），定时对账是&quot;没有资损&quot;的证据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"券生命周期、核销与退款回退","id":"券生命周期-核销与退款回退"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"状态流转的原子性与竞态","id":"状态流转的原子性与竞态"},{"level":2,"text":"核销与业务系统的一致性","id":"核销与业务系统的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"退款回退：退钱还是退券","id":"退款回退-退钱还是退券"},{"level":2,"text":"对账：让生命周期可验证","id":"对账-让生命周期可验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高并发秒杀领券（库存化）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/budget-coupon/flash-coupon"},"next":{"title":"活动规则缓存与实时生效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/performance-safety/pricing-cache"}}